<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Ro ghoul</Major>
    <Description>This is a roblox macro on a game called Ro-Ghoul based of an anime called Tokyo ghoul. This macros allows u to do the auto combo of a quinque called SSS-OWL (500M yen). To run this macro perfectly u need to have under 150ms. 
You also need to be on Range mode to do the combo. The combo deals nearly half player damage. U can assign to any key u want but i suggest to asing it to F.

If u want guide to install
1. Download keyran from https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 
2. Download this macro
3. If u want to use macro buy the subscription or u can use for 2 hour for free
4. Once u download then assign t to key u want
5. And enjoy the macro!!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 9 1
Delay 105 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 135 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 105 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 105 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyUp 21 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>